@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & Conditions";
}

<div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 850px;">
    <div class="card-tech p-4 p-md-5">
        <h1 class="mb-4" style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 2.2rem;">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

        <div class="compliance-banner mb-4">
            <strong>Regulatory Disclosure:</strong> The TECH Prize Draw is a limited promotional skill and randomized technology prize draw designed for Bangladesh. Participation requires independent acknowledgment that live commercial prize draws are governed by relevant Bangladesh legal, tax, and licensing frameworks.
        </div>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">1. Eligibility</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Participants must be at least 18 years of age and legal residents of Bangladesh. Employees, immediate family members, and administrative operators of the platform are strictly prohibited from participating.
        </p>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">2. Ticket Inventory & Price</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            The entry price is <strong>৳50 BDT</strong> per ticket. The total ticket inventory is strictly limited to <strong>5,000 valid tickets</strong> across the entire campaign duration. No additional tickets will be created or sold under this campaign.
        </p>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">3. Payment & Manual Verification</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Payments must be completed manually via the official bKash or Nagad accounts listed on the platform. The participant is solely responsible for entering the correct Transaction ID (TrxID). Submission of a transaction ID does not constitute a valid ticket until independent manual verification and approval by the administrative team.
        </p>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">4. Rejections & Refund Policy</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Submissions with fraudulent, duplicate, invalid, or mismatched transaction IDs will be rejected. In the event of a rejected payment where funds were genuinely transferred, the participant must contact support within 7 business days with proof of MFS debit to request review or manual refund.
        </p>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">5. Draw Conduct & Prizes</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Prizes will be drawn upon campaign completion using a cryptographically audited pseudorandom number algorithm. Winners will be contacted via registered email and mobile number. Prizes are non-transferable and non-convertible to cash unless explicitly authorized by the platform operators.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
